BT /F1 10 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 40 625 Td 14 TL
(AuctionFlex360 (AF360) is an enterprise cloud auction ERP platform developed by Sandhills Global.) Tj T*
(It connects two core stakeholders in every auction business:) Tj T*
(  1. Consignor (Seller): Brings items/inventory to be sold on commission.) Tj T*
(  2. Bidder (Buyer): Registers, bids live or online, and makes payments for won lots.) Tj T*
(AF360 automates this entire lifecycle from intake to cataloging, live bidding, and consignor checks.) Tj ET
