(The Customers Module houses the universal registry for all buyers, consignors, and vendors.) Tj T*
(  * Customer List: Main CRM table. In your live account, code f778f81f-6 is Chandan Kumar (bitlyze).) Tj T*
(  * Dual Role Architecture: A customer record can simultaneously be a Consignor (seller) and a Bidder.) Tj T*
(  * Permanent Bidders: VIP recurring buyers assigned static paddle numbers (e.g. Card #5).) Tj T*
(  * Mailing Lists: Segmentation for marketing blasts based on interest (Art, Heavy Equipment, Coins).) Tj T*
(  * Action Buttons: + NEW CUSTOMER (single entry), IMPORT CUSTOMERS (bulk CSV), EXPORT CUSTOMER.) Tj ET
0.15 0.39 0.92 rg 40 330 4 16 re f
