BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 40 300 Td 13 TL
(This module establishes the financial and operational settings of your auction company:) Tj T*
(  * Accounts (Chart of Accounts): Live record verified: Account #1010 | Type: ASSET | 'money in or out'.) Tj T*
(    Manages double-entry bookkeeping: Cash receipts, commission revenue, and tax liabilities.) Tj T*
(  * Formulas: Sliding-scale commission calculators (e.g. 20% under $500, 15% thereafter) & Buyer's Premium.) Tj T*
(  * Payment Processor: Merchant gateway configuration (Global Payments) for credit card self-checkout.) Tj T*
(  * User List: Staff credentials with role-based permissions (Super Admin, Clerk, Cashier, Cataloger).) Tj T*
(  * Company Details: Legal name, physical auction house address, auctioneer state licenses, and tax IDs.) Tj ET
