(  * Lots Sub-tab: Inventory cataloging. Har item ko Lot #, Title, Description, Consignor Code aur) Tj T*
(    Reserve Price ke sath tag kiya jata hai. Unsold items reserve price ke neeche nahi bikte.) Tj T*
(  * Action Buttons: + NEW LOT (manual), IMPORT LOTS (bulk CSV/Excel), IMPORT LOTS BY BARCODE,) Tj T*
(    SCAN LOT (warehouse handheld scanner), SALE ORDER (re-order lot sequence).) Tj T*
(  * Lot Images: Drag-and-drop multi-photo batch uploader with automated cloud thumbnails.) Tj T*
(  * Expenses Sub-tab: Advertising costs, labor, and transport deductions logged against the auction.) Tj ET
