BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 40 572 Td 13 TL
(  * Clerking Sub-tab (Core Engine): Clerk records winning bids in real time as auctioneer sells.) Tj T*
(    - Pre-Cataloged Mode: Item is already on screen. Clerk types Hammer Price (e.g. $450) and) Tj T*
(      Bidder Card # (e.g. 102) and presses Enter. Advances to next lot in under 3 seconds.) Tj T*
(    - On-The-Fly Mode: For uncataloged estate/storage sales. Clerk types item description live.) Tj T*
(  * Alternate Bids Sub-tab: Auto-notifies clerk when floor bids challenge absentee/phone bids.) Tj ET
