BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.3 rg 50 490 Td (Batch Clerk Action: Bidding close hone ke baad admin Batch Clerk chalata hai jo sabhi winning lots group karta hai.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.3 rg 50 478 Td (Settlement vs. Invoice: Settlement internal tax audit sheet hai; Invoice external online payment bill hai.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 40 452 Td 13 TL
(  * BATCH SHIPMENTS: Calculates shipping weight and courier freight for winning bidders.) Tj T*
(  * UPDATE INVOICES: Refreshes total payable balance with packing, freight, and sales tax.) Tj T*
(  * PRINT / EMAIL: Batch dispatches payment link via SMS/Email to winning buyers for online checkout.) Tj T*
(  * Seller Settlement: Consignor ka commission (e.g. 15%) aur fees kaat kar net payout check release karta hai.) Tj ET
