(The Reporting Portal provides visual intelligence, exports, and executive company configuration:) Tj T*
(  * Hammer Value Widget: Displays Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) across completed auctions.) Tj T*
(  * Auctions Held: Total event counter (Currently 2 in bitlyze account: 'fgf' and 'XCXZC').) Tj T*
(  * Lots by Clerking Status: Real-time pie chart of Sold, Unsold/Passed, and Pending lots.) Tj T*
(  * Reports Library: Certified accounting reports, consignor statements, sales tax audits, IRS 1099s.) Tj T*
(  * Settings (/settings): Custom Company Logo Uploader (Max 500KB) watermarked on all invoices & paddles.) Tj ET
