BT /F2 11 Tf 0.7 0.4 0.05 rg 52 475 Td (Hinglish Summary & Operational Takeaways (Aapke Liye Zaroori Baatein):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 52 458 Td 13 TL
(1. System ek unified ERP hai jahan Consignor (maal bechne wala) aur Bidder (khareedne wala) dono) Tj T*
(   Customers module me maintain hote hain.) Tj T*
(2. Auction Day me live clerking sirf Hammer Price aur Paddle Card number daal kar Enter dabane se chalti hai.) Tj T*
(3. Settlement ke waqt Batch Clerk chalta hai jisse sabhi jeete hue items group hokar Invoices ban jate hain) Tj T*
(   aur direct online credit card payment link SMS/Email chala jata hai.) Tj T*
(4. Seller Settlement me consignor ka 15% commission automatic cut hokar unka net bank check print hota hai.) Tj T*
(5. Reporting Portal (portal.auctionflex360.com) me Hammer Value aur tax audit documents live update hote hain.) Tj ET
